Freedom of Information Ordinance (FoIO)
SR 152.31 — Ordinance of 24 May 2006 on Freedom of Information in the Administration (Freedom of Information Ordinance, FoIO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2006/356]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 1 November 2023, which is also the date of the current binding text.

:INFO
Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
on the basis of Articles 2 para. 3, 10 para. 2 and 4, 17 para. 3 and 21 of the Federal Act of 17 December 2004 on Freedom of Information in the Administration (Freedom of Information Act, FoIA),
ordains:
